 "text": "Hello there! How's your day treating you? That's a common problem. One way to fix is to start with a simple line drawing of the eye as guide line on each page. Half way gives you a tall eye, full gives you a huge one. Start almost at the top of the face. For noses, either side line helps, Or draw the nose first, then the eye. Whichever you use, do it each time and watch how the eyes change. Enjoying the same tea while you do will get you two good habits.",
